# ── Invite variant ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Which ceremonies this build shows. Each Vercel project sets a different value
# so one repo deploys three invites. Omit (or leave blank) for the full invite.
#
#   full                 every ceremony
#   engagement-wedding   Engagement + Wedding Ceremony
#   wedding              Wedding Ceremony only
#
# Local testing: copy this file to .env.local and set the value, then `npm run dev`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_INVITE_VARIANT=full

# ── Absolute site URL (used for link-preview images) ─────────
# Vercel sets this automatically; only needed for custom domains or local OG testing.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app
